      "name": "Planar Incarnation - Netherworld (The Mutilated)",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>All shades are formed from and personify the nature of the plane on which they manifest, and their statistics are adjusted as summarized below. They also gain any trait associated with creatures from their plane.</p>\n<p><strong>Shadow Plane (The Mutilated)</strong> The mutilated appear as they did in their mortal lives, yet are covered in wounds or partially adorned or wrapped in chains.</p><ul><li><strong>Sanctification</strong> unholy</li><li><strong>Language</strong> Shadowtongue</li><li><strong>Additional Ability</strong> immune to bleed and fear</li><li><strong>Melee</strong> chain +7, <strong>Damage</strong> 1d8+2 bludgeoning</li></ul>",
